In the default auto mode, interactive create follows the Linear user setting autoAssignToSelf (on in this workspace).
-- env --
LINEAR_TEAM_KEY=ENG
-- tty --
expect What's the title of your issue?
send Auto assign from Linear settings\r
expect Description
send \r
expect What's next?
send \r
-- run --
linear issue create
